# InsightFace pretrained weights (buffalo_m pack).
#
# Excluded on licensing grounds, not size — they are LFS-tracked and would
# upload fine. InsightFace releases its code under MIT but its pretrained model
# packs for non-commercial research use only, and this is an operational border
# screening system. Redistributing them here would publish them under terms the
# upstream project does not grant.
#
# The files stay on disk and the service runs normally. See
# services/face-verification/models/buffalo_m/README.md for how to obtain them.
services/face-verification/models/buffalo_m/*.onnx
